Therefore,

$ g(x + 1) \leq g(x) $

Therefore, we have:

$ g(x + 1) \leq g(x) $

and

$ g(x + 5) \geq g(x) $

Therefore, combining these two results:

For any real number $ x $, we have:

$ g(x + 1) \leq g(x) $

and

$ g(x + 5) \geq g(x) $

Therefore, for any integer $ n $, we have:

$ g(x + 5n) \geq g(x) $

and

